@startuml
allowmixing
title UC06 — Classes et modules réellement présents (FastAPI)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 65
set namespaceSeparator none
top to bottom direction

package "Entrée HTTP : app/main.py" {
  class ConfirmRequest <<Pydantic BaseModel>> {
    +applicationId: UUID
    model_config: extra = forbid
  }
  class "app.main" as Main <<module Python>> {
    +confirm(payload: ConfirmRequest): dict
    +health(): dict
  }
}
package "Métier : fonctions et exception" {
  class "app.service" as Service <<module Python>> {
    +confirm_assignment(engine, application_id): dict
  }
  class AssignmentError <<Exception>> {
    +status_code: int
    +__init__(message: str, status_code: int = 409)
  }
  class "app.policy" as Policy <<module Python>> {
    +all_members_confirmed(members: list): bool
    +capacity_reached(current: int, maximum: int): bool
  }
}
package "Accès aux données" {
  class "app.db" as Db <<module Python>> {
    +get_engine(): Engine
  }
  class Engine <<SQLAlchemy>> {
    +begin(): transaction context
  }
  class Connection <<SQLAlchemy>> {
    +execute(statement, parameters): Result
  }
  database "PostgreSQL 16" as PG
}
Main ..> ConfirmRequest : entrée validée
Main --> Service : appelle
Main --> Db : obtient l'Engine
Main ..> AssignmentError : traduit en erreur HTTP
Service ..> AssignmentError : lève
Service ..> Policy : contrôle
Db --> Engine : create_engine
Service --> Engine : engine.begin()
Engine --> Connection : fournit dans la transaction
Service --> Connection : SQL explicite avec text()
Connection --> PG : verrous et écritures

note bottom of Service
Transaction, contrôle des quotas et unicité.
Le service porte aussi les requêtes SQL.
Pas de repository Python séparé.
end note
note bottom of PG
Tables : applications, pfa_groups, group_members,
teacher_capacities, students, subjects,
assignments, assignment_members.
Ce ne sont pas des classes ORM Python.
end note
footer Sources : backend-fastapi/app et database/01_schema.sql
@enduml
